1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,502
Your agent keeps asking:

2
00:00:01,502 --> 00:00:02,800
is it done yet?

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,883
Poll often,

4
00:00:05,883 --> 00:00:06,368
and you burn rate

5
00:00:06,368 --> 00:00:06,854
limit on requests

6
00:00:06,854 --> 00:00:07,366
that mostly return

7
00:00:07,366 --> 00:00:08,200
nothing new.

8
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,592
Wait longer between checks,

9
00:00:09,592 --> 00:00:10,830
and feedback sits until

10
00:00:10,830 --> 00:00:12,100
the next one.

11
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:12,887
Think doorbell,

12
00:00:12,887 --> 00:00:14,900
not knocking again and again.

13
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:16,018
GitHub Event Streams

14
00:00:16,018 --> 00:00:17,295
lets an agent subscribe

15
00:00:17,295 --> 00:00:18,540
to a pull request.

16
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:19,953
It keeps a connection

17
00:00:19,953 --> 00:00:21,933
open, and events arrive.

18
00:00:21,933 --> 00:00:22,764
In the CLI,

19
00:00:22,764 --> 00:00:24,047
G H event listen

20
00:00:24,047 --> 00:00:25,633
takes a pull request

21
00:00:25,633 --> 00:00:27,036
link. Add the events

22
00:00:27,036 --> 00:00:27,479
you want,

23
00:00:27,479 --> 00:00:29,167
like a submitted review.

24
00:00:29,167 --> 00:00:30,509
It prints each event

25
00:00:30,509 --> 00:00:31,788
as one line of JSON,

26
00:00:31,788 --> 00:00:32,811
then, by default,

27
00:00:32,811 --> 00:00:34,767
exits after the first.

28
00:00:34,767 --> 00:00:36,054
Your agent sleeps while

29
00:00:36,054 --> 00:00:36,858
there's no work,

30
00:00:36,858 --> 00:00:37,824
and wakes as soon

31
00:00:37,824 --> 00:00:39,033
as there is.

32
00:00:39,033 --> 00:00:40,042
No public webhook

33
00:00:40,042 --> 00:00:41,220
endpoint, so it works

34
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:42,400
on a laptop.

35
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,228
It's preview,

36
00:00:43,228 --> 00:00:44,195
waitlist only,

37
00:00:44,195 --> 00:00:45,733
and may change.

38
00:00:45,733 --> 00:00:46,996
Which agent loop would

39
00:00:46,996 --> 00:00:47,764
you fix first?

40
00:00:47,764 --> 00:00:48,867
Tell me below.

